      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:19.677665Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 3: generic_file_write_iter",
      "source_hash": 17374309821805724151,
      "context_hash": 5262100893651121620,
      "translation": "3단계: generic_file_write_iter",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:19.677665Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "For regular files, the filesystem's `write_iter` (e.g., `ext4_file_write_iter`) eventually calls `generic_file_write_iter()`:",
      "source_hash": 2666944843879858974,
      "context_hash": 17177560565808061383,
      "translation": "일반 파일의 경우 파일시스템의 `write_iter`(예: `ext4_file_write_iter`)가 최종적으로 `generic_file_write_iter()`를 호출합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:19.677665Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 4: writing to the page cache",
      "source_hash": 9121820772552082195,
      "context_hash": 14702388598412395102,
      "translation": "4단계: 페이지 캐시에 쓰기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "page cache": "페이지 캐시"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:19.677665Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`generic_perform_write()` loops over each page needed:",
      "source_hash": 10505246360585241088,
      "context_hash": 10710275296884781874,
      "translation": "`generic_perform_write()`는 필요한 각 페이지를 순회합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:19.677666Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 5: dirty tracking",
      "source_hash": 5276664464679339930,
      "context_hash": 3218535742907469511,
      "translation": "5단계: dirty 추적",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:19.677666Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "After `set_page_dirty()`, multiple structures are marked dirty:",
      "source_hash": 15003752251198398207,
      "context_hash": 5973266606664043586,
      "translation": "`set_page_dirty()` 이후에는 여러 구조체가 dirty로 표시됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:19.677666Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 6: writeback",
      "source_hash": 786394757816838486,
      "context_hash": 10873625337734791799,
      "translation": "6단계: writeback",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "writeback": "writeback"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:19.677666Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The writeback daemon (`kworker`) periodically flushes dirty pages to disk:",
      "source_hash": 9331122988915448294,
      "context_hash": 10524098006445669201,
      "translation": "writeback 데몬(`kworker`)은 주기적으로 dirty 페이지를 디스크로 플러시합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "daemon": "데몬",
        "dirty page": "dirty 페이지",
        "writeback": "writeback"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:19.677667Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Writeback is triggered by:",
      "source_hash": 4654312460665504639,
      "context_hash": 2487789047921206291,
      "translation": "writeback이 트리거되는 경우:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "writeback": "writeback"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:19.677667Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**Time**: after `dirty_expire_centisecs` (default 3000 = 30 seconds)",
      "source_hash": 13913876924721354663,
      "context_hash": 6395921574388698256,
      "translation": "**시간**: `dirty_expire_centisecs` 경과 후 (기본값 3000 = 30초)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:19.677667Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "**Memory pressure**: when dirty pages exceed `dirty_ratio` (default 20% of RAM)",
      "source_hash": 996428510922400790,
      "context_hash": 2808711861465015629,
      "translation": "**메모리 압박**: dirty 페이지가 `dirty_ratio`를 초과할 때 (기본값 RAM의 20%)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RAM": "RAM",
        "dirty page": "dirty 페이지"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:55:19.677667Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "**fsync()**: explicit flush by the application",
